src/**/*.jpeg
src/**/*.png
src/**/*.webp
src/**/*.avif
src/**/*.tif
src/**/*.tiff
src/**/*.heic

# test reports, failure screenshots and traces: published to R2 (`npm run test:record`), never committed
test-results/
